</td></tr></table>
<p><b>Notes:</b>
</p>
<ol><li>The worksheets name must have a unique suffix, to stand out from other Mods. This can be any you like.</li>
<li>Use any unique ID, by taking into account that Bioware reserves 0-1million.</li>
<li>"cam100ar_camp_plains" is the normal Camp Area, this is where the Script will be run.</li>
<li>"mygnome_script" is the Script to run, without "nss" file extenstion.</li></ol>
